OL,3,ATrump says Canada wants 'benefits' of
OL,4,Abeing US state after trade talks
OL,5,Acollapse
OL,6,
OL,7,FCarney confirmed he would match Trump's
OL,8,Ftariffs "dollar-for-dollar" from 8
OL,9,FSeptember, including levies on steel,
OL,10,Fdairy, appliances and electronics,
OL,11,Fsaying the US and Canada were now in a
OL,12,Ftrade war.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
